1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:12,539
To count them, use a measure phrase: two pieces of information, several pieces of advice, a piece of good news, three pieces of luggage, a loaf of bread, a clap of thunder.

2
00:00:12,539 --> 00:00:23,463
Some nouns are plural only and take a plural verb: scissors, trousers, spectacles, clothes, cattle, police, people; count them with a pair of.

3
00:00:23,463 --> 00:00:28,632
And news is singular despite its s: the news is encouraging.

